{"unit_id": "tag:01MB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个分次环（graded ring）。\n局部赋环空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0002>是一个概形（scheme）。\n标准开集（standard opens）<MATH_0003>是仿射开集（affine opens）。\n对任意分次（graded）<MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005>，层（sheaf）\n<MATH_0006>是一个<MATH_0007>-模（modules）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部赋环空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "假设中给定的带分次结构的环。"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部赋环空间", "context": "描述证明其为概形之前的空间结构。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "断言给定的局部赋环空间具有概形结构。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "指给定概形的标准开集。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "说明所给标准开集是仿射的。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰给定环上的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指构造该层所用的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指由给定分次模得到的层。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指定拟凝聚层的模结构。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "断言由分次模得到的层具有拟凝聚性。"}], "notes": []}
