{"unit_id": "tag:01MD:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个分次环（graded ring）。\n概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），当且仅当存在有限多个齐次（homogeneous）元素（elements）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>。在这种情况下，<MATH_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "假设中给定的带分次结构的环。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指考察其拟紧性的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "指等价命题中所刻画的性质。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "限定存在性条件中的元素。"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指存在性条件中要求的有限多个对象。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01MD:proof", "translation": "给定这样一组元素（elements），相应的标准仿射开集（affine opens）\n<MATH_0001>覆盖（cover）<MATH_0002>，这由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>可知。\n反之，若<MATH_0003>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），则可用有限多个标准开集（standard opens）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>覆盖（cover）它，并由上述引理可知<MATH_0006>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "cover", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "cover", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指命题所述的一组齐次元素。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指与给定元素对应的标准仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "cover", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "说明这些标准仿射开集覆盖所指定的空间。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用的章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的", "context": "逆向论证的假设。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "指由拟紧性选取的有限多个标准开集。"}, {"source_term": "cover", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "说明所取的开集覆盖该空间。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01ME:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个分次环（graded ring）。概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>有一个到仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0003>的典范态射（canonical morphism），它与拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的映射（map）一致，后者来自代数（Algebra）一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "假设中给定的带分次结构的环。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指典范态射的出发对象。"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "指典范态射的目标对象。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指从给定概形到指定仿射概形的态射。"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指所比较的映射所在的空间。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由所引定义给出的拓扑空间之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用的章节名称。"}], "notes": []}
